# Trivia monorepo

`web/` = React 19 + Vite 8 SPA. `api/` = Genkit/Express on `127.0.0.1:3000`. Production static files live in `/var/www/trivia.benlamb.net/` (artifacts only — never edit by hand).

## Workflow (single maintainer)

- One person runs this repo — work on **`main`**; no feature branches, worktrees, or PRs unless explicitly requested.
- Commit and push to `main` when asked; deploy runs on push via GitHub Actions.

## API contract (change both sides)

| Endpoint | Shape |
|----------|--------|
| `GET /api/health` | `{ status: "ok" }` |
| `POST /api/questions` | `{ questions: [{ category, text, options[4], correctAnswer }] × 25 }` |
| `POST /api/results` | body `{ score, total }` → `{ title, evaluation, motivation }` |

Wire format: `api/index.js` (zod + flows) and `web/services/triviaApi.ts`. Frontend assigns `id` and shuffles options via `web/lib/shuffleArray.ts`.

## Security

- `GOOGLE_GENAI_API_KEY` only in `api/.env` — never commit, never bundle in `web/`.
- After frontend changes: `cd web && npm run verify:bundle` (no `@google/genai`, no `AIza...` in `dist/assets/*.js`).

## Do not

- Commit `api/.env`, `web/dist/`, `node_modules/`.
- Change `/api/` JSON in only `api/` or only `web/`.
- Hand-deploy into `/var/www/trivia.benlamb.net/` except via deploy workflow.

Details: `CLAUDE.md`, `README.md`.
